<verdict_criteria>
## Verdict Criteria

### APPROVED ✅
- Zero critical issues
- Zero major issues (or major issues are acceptable trade-offs documented in plan)
- Code is ready for execution

### NEEDS_FIX ⚠️
- One or more critical or major issues
- Issues are fixable by the Code Agent
- Return to Code Agent with specific fix instructions

### REJECTED ❌
- Fundamental issues requiring re-planning
- Script doesn't match the migration plan intent
- Architecture-level problems that can't be fixed by editing
- Escalate to main agent or user
</verdict_criteria>

